Package: surviver
Title: Estimate Time-Varying Vaccine Effectiveness
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kylie", "Ainslie", , "ainslie.kylie@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Methods for estimating vaccine effectiveness as a function of
    time since vaccination from individual-level surveillance data,
    including simulated ground-truth datasets for validating estimators.
